{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"valid\": true,\n  \"entry\": \"上半屏左侧两行大号白紫标题，首先落在紫色强调的“舍不得被当作自己人的日子”和“连那些气也肯再受”，随后注意到下方另一句大号标题。\",\n  \"grasp_who\": \"他正在考虑回去，但似乎在怀念曾经被接纳的日子和害怕孤单之间摇摆。\",\n  \"grasp_feel\": \"不舍、孤独感、犹豫、心慌。\",\n  \"missed\": \"回去后可能再次承受的具体委屈，以及他已经重新认识过去的自己、知道过去经历了什么，却仍然没有答案的深层变化。\",\n  \"burden\": [\n    \"主标题是较长的两行句子，需要读完才能明确舍不得被接纳与害怕孤单之间的动机关系。\",\n    \"上下两处大号标题都比较醒目，第一处讲回去的原因，第二处讲心慌的反应，需要稍微移动视线。\",\n    \"中间的浅紫色说明文字连续铺成多行，包含多个层次，快速扫视难以提取。\"\n  ],\n  \"score\": 2\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "54c90c45-2ff3-449b-b289-ae5ad5485eb2", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261110T012544947027Z", "elapsed_seconds": 45.0, "completed_utc": "2026-11-10T01:26:29.959591+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "e07bd236cd3d2d049a16552d6e1c861b28af2737c0887132ff1d333a41e81468", "attachment_count": 1}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 1, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3f